Fabian: I think it is Bijzondere Collecties or something like this. I can look it up and send you the link. It's really amazing. You have to pre-book all of the things that you want to see. And then they bring it out and you. For some of the stuff you need to wear the white gloves even. They have amazing things there. If you ever have the chance: go!

